  "body": "I was trying to figure out creation URL for the about:blank replacement case tonight and @bzbarsky spotted a problem with \"create new browsing context\".\r\n\r\nStep 3 of \"create new browsing context\":\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#creating-a-new-browsing-context\r\n\r\nCalls into \"set up browsing context environment settings object\":\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#set-up-a-browsing-context-environment-settings-object\r\n\r\nStep 3 of that algorithm says:\r\n\r\n  `Let url be a copy of the URL of window's associated Document.`\r\n\r\nBut the document is not set on the window until step 4 of \"create new browsing context\".",
